sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Board as Examination Board (Client)
    actor Faculty as Faculty Member
    actor Student as Student Candidate
    participant Svc as EvaluationService
    participant Fact as EvaluationStrategyFactory
    participant StratStd as StandardEvaluationStrategy
    participant StratNeg as NegativeMarkingStrategy
    participant DB as Persistence Layer

    Note over Board: Client Change Request CR-2026-004 Submitted
    Board->>Faculty: Mandate Negative Marking Option for Competitive Exams
    Faculty->>DB: Create Exam with enable_negative_marking = true

    Note over Student: Candidate Takes Competitive Exam
    Student->>Svc: Submit Exam Answers: [Q1=Correct, Q2=Incorrect, Q3=Unanswered]
    Svc->>DB: Check exam.enable_negative_marking
    DB-->>Svc: enable_negative_marking == True

    Svc->>Fact: get_strategy(True)
    Fact-->>Svc: NegativeMarkingStrategy Instance

    Svc->>StratNeg: evaluate_question(Q1, CorrectOption)
    StratNeg-->>Svc: +5.0 Marks
    Svc->>StratNeg: evaluate_question(Q2, IncorrectOption)
    StratNeg-->>Svc: -1.5 Marks (Penalty Deducted)
    Svc->>StratNeg: evaluate_question(Q3, None)
    StratNeg-->>Svc: 0.0 Marks (Zero Penalty for Unanswered)

    Svc->>Svc: Net Calculation: 5.0 - 1.5 + 0.0 = 3.5 Marks
    Svc->>Svc: Floor check: max(0.0, 3.5) = 3.5
    Svc->>DB: Seal Result Record (Score=3.5, Max=15.0)
    Svc-->>Student: 200 OK (Grade Sealed Transparently)